# leaselogic-pro

- Next.js 16 leasing calculator on Vercel; Supabase email/password + `public.authorized_users.is_active`.
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`. Never commit `.env.local`.
- Local dev: `cd leaselogic-pro && npm run dev` → **http://127.0.0.1:3010** (port 3010 in package.json).
- Production: **https://leaselogic-pro.vercel.app/** (deploy from GitHub `main`).

